{"id":"wb-7-1207","name":"镇平菩提寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"菩提寺 (南阳)","text":"菩提寺位于河南省南阳市镇平县老庄镇,据《菩提寺志》碑文记载：唐高宗永徽年间（650年—655年），菩提祖师朱智勤在老庄乡杏花山创建菩提寺，当时有房舍殿宇200余间，香田700亩，僧人170余名。寺内珍藏的《贝叶经》、缅甸佛像以及吴道子画，具有较高的历史价值。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8F%A9%E6%8F%90%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%8D%97%E9%98%B3)","revisionId":91746248,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91746248","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a6cbe860556d43c958b76a69.jpg","title":"20251005_Puti_Temple,_Zhenping_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251005_Puti_Temple,_Zhenping_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/20251005_Puti_Temple%2C_Zhenping_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​镇平 菩提寺","width":320,"height":213}}